  "description": "The Teammachine SLR 01 FIVE is undeniably Teammachine, with the ultimate race-bred geometry, iconic silhouette, and Impec Lab obsession to make it lighter, sharper, and faster through targeted stiffness and responsiveness.\nIts refined carbon layup using our 01 Pro Carbon grade is unapologetically stiff, giving exceptional power transfer on the uphills and sharp handling on the downs. It’s light where it counts, aero where it matters, and engineered in a package that opens up BMC SLR 01 level to more riders.\nTCC Race compliance adds smoothness without compromising on stiffness, giving it that unmistakable BMC confidence across every road surface.\nAll finished off with a SRAM Force AXS groupset with power meter for premium shifting, ICS Carbon Evo one-piece cockpit for better control, and our in-house CR 40 tubeless-ready carbon wheels so you roll fast on all gradients.",
